#: native/agentseat-eye.c:447
msgid "Collapse AgentSeat AI"
msgstr "收起 AgentSeat AI"

#: native/agentseat-eye.c:447 native/agentseat-eye.c:930
msgid "Expand the AgentSeat AI head"
msgstr "展開 AgentSeat AI 小腦袋"

#: native/agentseat-eye.c:560
msgid ""
"Got it. In a live session, the Agent operating this app reads and replies "
